player_prompt.intro:
I n'ye Jɛgɛ {player_id} ye 3-jɛgɛ Dilemme Prisonnier Itéré la. Match bɛ́ na {num_rounds} walasaw.
Walasa fasali:
• {conv_rounds} parolɛ́ sɔrɔw
• 1 kɛlɛli sɔrɔ - sɔrɔ́ cɛ́cɛ ka dɛmɛ kelen kɔ kɔnɔ kɔnɔ: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' walima '[<opp-id> defect]' (o la, '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; dɔw la 'cooperate').
Payoff matrisi pɛrɛ-pɛrɛn (kɔnɔ kɔnɔ pɛrɛ-pɛrɛn):
  - Ɔɔ ka jɛgɛw bɛ́ɛ kɛlɛ  ->  {reward}
  - Ɔɔ ka jɛgɛw bɛ́ɛ yɛrɛ     ->  {punishment}
  - I yɛrɛ, u kɛlɛ  -> {temptation}
  - I kɛlɛ, u yɛrɛ  -> {sucker}
Jɛgɛ (w) bɛ́ na dɔw sɔrɔ bɛ́ɛ kɔnɔ walasa wɔɔrɔ la, u bɛ́ sɔrɔ.
